# Dev-only tooling. Nothing in here is needed to view the site: `npx prettier`
# is the only command the README asks for, and it leaves no runtime dependency
# behind. Keeping node_modules out is what makes that claim stay true.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.npm/

